<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico monetary aggregates to Dec 1996.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico monetary aggregates to Dec 1996.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico on Monday released its preliminary monetary aggregates up to December 1996. All figures are in billions of pesos:</p>
<p>			 Nov95   Dec95   Nov96   Dec96</p>
<p> M1		    147.2   165.4   202.8   234.0</p>
<p> Notes/coins	  48.2    60.7    62.9    74.0</p>
<p> Checking accts     99.0   104.7   139.9   160.0</p>
<p> M4		    842.0   880.1 1,093.6 1,150.7</p>
<p>Bank deposits</p>
<p>    -private	 548.2   566.6   684.1   719.8</p>
<p>    -development    68.9    76.5   108.2   112.1</p>
<p>Securities</p>
<p>    -government    105.2   104.6   139.4   144.7</p>
<p>    -private	  24.0    23.2    20.6    20.7</p>
<p> Retirement savings 47.5    48.5    78.4    79.3</p>
<p>M1 measures notes and coints in circulation and checking accounts</p>
<p>M4 measures notes and coins in circulation as well as deposits in the banking system, holdings of private and government securities and funds in the Retirement Savings System (SAR).</p>
<p>-- Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9560</p>
